Why not do both? Ascend each role and add some conducts to the easier
ones to make things interesting.  Genocideless is a good first
conduct, in my opinion. It basically makes the pre-ascension run
endgame more difficult due to the liches and mindflayers (or whatever
you prefer to use the scrolls on), but doesn't affect things much
until you've had a chance to prepare a little.  Wishless is a step
up in difficulty, but is still easier than foodless or illiterate.
(At least, I'm assuming it is. I haven't tried a foodless or
illiterate game myself yet.)


